WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.151
Hi! Today is moving day. We have a new house!

2
00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:10.223
Look at all these boxes! Whose boxes are they?

3
00:00:10.673 --> 00:00:13.785
They're our boxes. They're ours!

4
00:00:16.035 --> 00:00:18.914
These books are my husband's books.

5
00:00:19.364 --> 00:00:22.243
They're his books. They're his!

6
00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:29.045
This old lamp is mine. It was my grandmother's lamp.

7
00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:34.592
And the cat? It's my daughter's cat.

8
00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:37.364
It's her cat. It's hers!

9
00:00:39.614 --> 00:00:44.304
Our new house is small, but it's ours, and we love it.

10
00:00:44.754 --> 00:00:48.191
And you? What's your favorite thing in your house?

